        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/e777c362a95fd0c49875c55d1f5b8a9b.avif?t=1777325748\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The candy factory has been taken over by an army of pesky treats, and you’re the only one who can stop them! Grab your waffle gun and other weapons to blast your way through <strong>8 expansive levels</strong> full of sugary foes, leading to an epic showdown with a powerful boss! Show them you have what it takes to restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know <strong>DOOM</strong>, you’ll feel right at home – it’s basically a sweet, frosting-covered retro-shooter experience! Throughout the fight, your best friend, <strong>Felek the dog</strong>, will be right by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/f8e41c4e6592e12ea6d5b791bad27722.avif?t=1777325748\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUNNY HOP MODE &amp; TIME ATTACK</strong> Bunnyhop? Sounds familiar! JUMP into the game and conquer <strong>4 incredible levels</strong> that demand focus and fast reflexes – all set to a high-energy <strong>Drum’n’Bass</strong> soundtrack! Not enough? Try <strong>TIME ATTACK</strong>! Complete one (or all) of the 5 levels as fast as possible and claim your spot on the global leaderboard! The top three players for each map are displayed in the <strong>TOP 3</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/323920fc2b1492a9b968b202104185a3.avif?t=1777325748\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKINS? OF COURSE!</strong> By playing TIME ATTACK, you can unlock <strong>32 different skins</strong> to choose from in the menu! As a bonus, you’ll receive them in your <strong>Steam Inventory</strong> as a souvenir! Don’t wait – unlock them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FASTHAND</strong> is the perfect blend of action and relaxation. Dive into intense battles or take a break in the menu with the built-in <strong>LOFI player</strong> (yes, your favorite chill tracks are there!). Wait, there’s more! The game features a <strong>PONG minigame</strong> for 2 players! With <strong>28 achievements</strong> to unlock, there’s always something to do. The game is constantly being developed, so expect even more content in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.poster.avif?t=1777325748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.webm?t=1777325748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.mp4?t=1777325748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.poster.avif?t=1777325748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.webm?t=1777325748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.mp4?t=1777325748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! This is my very first game – and yes, I’m developing it entirely solo! Since launch, I’ve learned so much, and you can see that progress in this description. I hope you have a blast playing! I’m still learning and will be adding regular updates. Thanks for giving my little project a chance. Every &quot;Play&quot; button click means the world to me! ❤️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun! 🎮</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/e777c362a95fd0c49875c55d1f5b8a9b.avif?t=1777325748\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The candy factory has been taken over by an army of pesky treats, and you’re the only one who can stop them! Grab your waffle gun and other weapons to blast your way through <strong>8 expansive levels</strong> full of sugary foes, leading to an epic showdown with a powerful boss! Show them you have what it takes to restore order!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you know <strong>DOOM</strong>, you’ll feel right at home – it’s basically a sweet, frosting-covered retro-shooter experience! Throughout the fight, your best friend, <strong>Felek the dog</strong>, will be right by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/f8e41c4e6592e12ea6d5b791bad27722.avif?t=1777325748\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUNNY HOP MODE &amp; TIME ATTACK</strong> Bunnyhop? Sounds familiar! JUMP into the game and conquer <strong>4 incredible levels</strong> that demand focus and fast reflexes – all set to a high-energy <strong>Drum’n’Bass</strong> soundtrack! Not enough? Try <strong>TIME ATTACK</strong>! Complete one (or all) of the 5 levels as fast as possible and claim your spot on the global leaderboard! The top three players for each map are displayed in the <strong>TOP 3</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/323920fc2b1492a9b968b202104185a3.avif?t=1777325748\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SKINS? OF COURSE!</strong> By playing TIME ATTACK, you can unlock <strong>32 different skins</strong> to choose from in the menu! As a bonus, you’ll receive them in your <strong>Steam Inventory</strong> as a souvenir! Don’t wait – unlock them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FASTHAND</strong> is the perfect blend of action and relaxation. Dive into intense battles or take a break in the menu with the built-in <strong>LOFI player</strong> (yes, your favorite chill tracks are there!). Wait, there’s more! The game features a <strong>PONG minigame</strong> for 2 players! With <strong>28 achievements</strong> to unlock, there’s always something to do. The game is constantly being developed, so expect even more content in the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.poster.avif?t=1777325748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.webm?t=1777325748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/dba7d8b0823542d19b8ee30b6d73bf37.mp4?t=1777325748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.poster.avif?t=1777325748\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.webm?t=1777325748\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3843070/extras/09138db764c8765d85b2021cea903d5b.mp4?t=1777325748\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hi! This is my very first game – and yes, I’m developing it entirely solo! Since launch, I’ve learned so much, and you can see that progress in this description. I hope you have a blast playing! I’m still learning and will be adding regular updates. Thanks for giving my little project a chance. Every &quot;Play&quot; button click means the world to me! ❤️</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun! 🎮</p>",
        "short_description": "Grab your cookie-powered weapons and stand your ground against waves of hostile candy creatures taking over the factory! Blast through colorful chaos, fight your way across intense levels, and prove you’ve got what it takes to defeat the ultimate gingerbread boss!",
